{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/131776404a7dc9014afbced943e11a20.webp?t=1770940243\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/131776404a7dc9014afbced943e11a20.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bedtime Stories is a 2D platformer where you herd monsters as the heroes in a fairytale world of the bedtime stories told by two struggling parents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/2c824777ea42115e53ebbe9f5a4fceaf.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" width=720 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/2c824777ea42115e53ebbe9f5a4fceaf.webm?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/2c824777ea42115e53ebbe9f5a4fceaf.mp4?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carefree Combat with No Death Penalty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no death penalty, and only a cool-down for healing. All the enemies will knock you back, but they can all be defeated by one hit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to finish the level as quickly as you can! Or just go through the level slowly to soak in the beautifully hand-drawn environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/9cf9439e87bafe423895bb95a936197c.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" width=720 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/9cf9439e87bafe423895bb95a936197c.webm?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/9cf9439e87bafe423895bb95a936197c.mp4?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three parallel timelines unfold as each parent takes turns telling their tales, reflecting their journey to reconcile their cultural differences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/55ae1a78026794060a774609c5c48856.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" width=780 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/55ae1a78026794060a774609c5c48856.webm?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Herd Fantastical Creatures and Return them to their Realm!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastical creatures inspired by traditional Indonesian theatre puppet shows, as well as Cantonese theatre puppet shows, are lurking in every corner! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/2626ddf574f3d60ec68370533114fa59.avif?t=1770940243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras_big/2626ddf574f3d60ec68370533114fa59.avif?t=1770940243 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Allies Along the Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend in need is a friend indeed! The allies will fight along with you and increase your stats! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/cc5dd59ce4bccf9e20ef5b2bcff063f6.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" width=720 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/cc5dd59ce4bccf9e20ef5b2bcff063f6.webm?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/cc5dd59ce4bccf9e20ef5b2bcff063f6.mp4?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Wholesome Family-friendly Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow along as the young family overcomes minor frustrations that arise from parenting differences, and celebrates common ground and everyday kindness across cultures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/6f5d0acde97bfcaa3ebed618f5809acf.avif?t=1770940243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras_big/6f5d0acde97bfcaa3ebed618f5809acf.avif?t=1770940243 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, care-free combat in imaginary worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgiving platforming and combat with no death penalty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-verbal game with music and sound effects, but not voice acting, where parents can read out the story like a book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities that you can learn to reach new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Artefacts that you can\u00a0collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue allies to join you on your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusion music inspired by traditional Cantonese as well as Indonesian instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-warming story of growing up in a mixed-cultured family</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388740?t=1770940243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388740?t=1770940243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/306583ad05657b0ae84b2fd8e47e0973ee8cf158/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770940243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/306583ad05657b0ae84b2fd8e47e0973ee8cf158/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770940243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/131776404a7dc9014afbced943e11a20.webp?t=1770940243\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/131776404a7dc9014afbced943e11a20.poster.avif?t=1770940243\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bedtime Stories is a 2D platformer where you herd monsters as the heroes in a fairytale world of the bedtime stories told by two struggling parents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l