om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/cc5dd59ce4bccf9e20ef5b2bcff063f6.mp4?t=1770940243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the Wholesome Family-friendly Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow along as the young family overcomes minor frustrations that arise from parenting differences, and celebrates common ground and everyday kindness across cultures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras/6f5d0acde97bfcaa3ebed618f5809acf.avif?t=1770940243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/extras_big/6f5d0acde97bfcaa3ebed618f5809acf.avif?t=1770940243 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, care-free combat in imaginary worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgiving platforming and combat with no death penalty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-verbal game with music and sound effects, but not voice acting, where parents can read out the story like a book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special abilities that you can learn to reach new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Artefacts that you can\u00a0collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue allies to join you on your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fusion music inspired by traditional Cantonese as well as Indonesian instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart-warming story of growing up in a mixed-cultured family</p></li></ul>","developers":["Liquid Heart"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388740/f57f2bad74bba6ff711335fb533b6aa66c5669fb/header.jpg?t=1770940243","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],